body:
Hi @AnnAngela, thanks for the issue!

You're right, this looks like an oversight. But, this rule is [deprecated](https://eslint.org/docs/latest/rules/prefer-reflect) so we are not making any further changes to it.

To avoid this problem, you can add `"getOwnPropertyNames"` to [`exceptions`](https://eslint.org/docs/latest/rules/prefer-reflect#exceptions):

```json
{
    "rules": {
        "prefer-reflect": ["error", { "exceptions": ["getOwnPropertyNames"] }]
    }
}
```

[Playground example](https://eslint.org/play/#)
